# A Sovereign-class battleship, which its definition loads at scaleSOD 1.4, beside an unscaled Defiant-class destroyer
# on layouts/scale.jsonc. The first shot shows both at their sizes, the second the Sovereign selected (its ring is its
# radius) and firing from its hardpoints.
# Run it with --layout layouts/scale.jsonc; the layout's header comment has the whole command.
scroll up 10
wait 0.5
shot sizes
select Sovereign
attack Defiant
wait 1.5
shot firing
dump firing
